  "description": "FlowLite.Diag is a .NET CLI tool that scans your project for FlowTransitionBuilder declarations and generates visual FSM diagrams in Mermaid or DOT format. Features: - parses C# source files for **FlowTransitionBuilder** usage, - generates state diagrams for each builder,- supports Mermaid.js and Graphviz DOT output formats, - designed to aid in debugging, documentation, and understanding workflows",
